  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Bring a large saucepan of salted water to the boil.<br>• Peel potato and cut into large chunks.<br>• Cook potato in the boiling water until easily <br>pierced with a fork, 12-15 minutes. Drain and <br>return to the pan.<br>• Add the milk and half the butter to the potato. <br>Mash until smooth and season to taste with salt and <br>pepper. Cover to keep warm. </p> <p><br>TIP: Save time and get more fibre by leaving the potato <br>unpeeled!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688033d90e296dba6fd69602/step-d9bc1300.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic.<br>• Thinly slice brown onion (see ingredients).<br>• Trim and halve green beans. <br>• Thinly slice flat mushrooms (see ingredients). </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688033d90e296dba6fd69602/step-ccb2bd10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over <br>high heat. Cook green beans, tossing, until tender, <br>5-6 minutes.<br>• Add half the garlic and cook until fragrant, <br>1 minute. Season to taste, transfer to a bowl and <br>cover to keep warm. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688033d90e296dba6fd69602/step-79c33520.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Wipe out the frying pan, then return to high heat <br>with a generous drizzle of olive oil. Cook flat<br>mushrooms and sliced mushrooms, tossing, until <br>browned, 4-5 minutes.<br>• Add onion and cook, stirring, until tender, <br>4-5 minutes. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688033d90e296dba6fd69602/step-c1cfb830.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Add tomato paste, garlic &amp; herb seasoning, <br>remaining garlic and remaining butter and cook <br>until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.<br>• Add light cooking cream, stock concentrate, Dijon<br>mustard and the water and cook until slightly <br>thickened, 2-3 minutes. Season to taste. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688033d90e296dba6fd69602/step-b0934f40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide mashed potato between bowls.<br>• Top with creamy mushroom medley stroganoff.<br>• Serve with garlicky greens. Enjoy! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688033d90e296dba6fd69602/step-56bdf050.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
